<title>USA: Western Pacific, Frontier in talks.</title>
<headline>Western Pacific, Frontier in talks.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Pacific Airlines Inc on Tuesday said it has had discussions with Frontier Airlines regarding a possible merger or other business combination.</p>
<p>&quot;If a definitive agreement is reached, an announcement will be made at that time,&quot; Western Pacific said in a statement Tuesday evening.</p>
<p>Frontier also acknowledged the talks with Western Pacific, saying in a separate statement that &quot;no agreement in principle exists regarding such a combination or any other cooperative arrangement.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
